  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0116",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "魚……熱帯魚だな\r\nアクアリウムショップか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003006020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "小さな水族館みたいだねっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300602/2003006020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003006020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねえ、プロデューサーはどの魚が好き？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300602/2003006020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなあ……\r\nおっ、こいつはすごくヒラヒラしてるぞ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003006020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ホントだー！　色も絵の具で塗ったみたい！\r\nこんなのが自然に生まれてくるなんて不思議だね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300602/2003006020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003006020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あれ……？　こっちの魚は\r\nこの水槽で１匹だけ色が違うよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300602/2003006020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当だ。違う種類なのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
